{"id": "official:sentence:68777a33-4aec-40dd-bda0-9a15e97988b3", "text": "你不能指望我一切都考虑周到！", "shortMeaning": "你别指望我样样都想周全！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0400e0b1-0e65-4b8d-82c5-c22577d5890d", "text": "你不能指望我一直考虑周到！", "shortMeaning": "别指望我时时都周到！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e50ff47b-74ff-4829-a862-9dad71f8256d", "text": "你不能未经允许就看别人的私人信件。", "shortMeaning": "没得允许不能看别人的私信。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2c60d730-47c6-404d-92a3-366987a50863", "text": "你不能要我做我不想做的事。", "shortMeaning": "你不能逼我做我不愿做的事。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2921a346-5353-4538-a8c1-0466ba39ad33", "text": "你不能跟我们一起去。", "shortMeaning": "你不能跟我们一道去。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b6551234-0877-4c25-8f89-fe39f834754b", "text": "你不能跟我们进来。", "shortMeaning": "你不能跟着我们进屋。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:48400d2d-158a-474b-89c7-30c5caa9f040", "text": "你不要生我气啦，我这么做也是为了你的。", "shortMeaning": "别生我的气，我这也是为你。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cf17d2b8-98f3-411b-a9eb-980bf61686d4", "text": "你不要用嘴呼吸，用鼻呼吸。", "shortMeaning": "别用嘴喘气，用鼻子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:824f2c42-a507-46a4-81ee-a62d28c5de4d", "text": "你不要逼我逼你，我不想逼你。", "shortMeaning": "别让我来逼你，我也不想逼。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e06445d5-f17c-456d-8d1c-cb7289f9ebbc", "text": "你不要随意评判别人的传统文化。", "shortMeaning": "别随口评人家的老规矩。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7866dbbd-109a-4f97-bc71-fa3eca02adff", "text": "你不觉得他有很多缺点吗？", "shortMeaning": "你不觉得他毛病不少吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d05a3e98-6526-43eb-9bc3-a8c6b0570ecd", "text": "你不觉得这房里的冷气太强了吗？", "shortMeaning": "你不觉得屋里冷气太足吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c49e267f-5f8a-4c2a-a071-02dbafceb88e", "text": "你不许看这些书，因为它对你不好。", "shortMeaning": "这些书不许看，对你没好处。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7dc3c845-d082-4e33-b9c8-6edffed5d0ea", "text": "你不该做这样一件事情。", "shortMeaning": "这种事你不该做。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cbc85062-e093-494b-b915-9536983b3faf", "text": "你不该吃太多冰激淋和太多意大利面。", "shortMeaning": "冰淇淋和意面都别吃太多。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9d117c08-eec2-449b-af94-365c39ab6ffa", "text": "你不该吃那么多冰激凌的。", "shortMeaning": "那么多冰淇淋，你不该吃。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6898b526-19d9-4268-be8f-0088fc3d1b8f", "text": "你不该把这事告诉她。", "shortMeaning": "这事你不该跟她讲。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c6e75585-0e79-4124-8dba-425362432c8f", "text": "你不该抽那么多烟。", "shortMeaning": "烟不该抽这么凶。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e2a38d44-ee9b-4fb5-a358-aa338ece5d4d", "text": "你不该玩弄他的感情。", "shortMeaning": "你不该拿他的感情开玩笑。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f97aed55-0b14-4c2b-81eb-0b0ad5caede6", "text": "你不该让他们等那么久。", "shortMeaning": "不该叫他们等这么久。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9a5a1278-ff0b-4527-a96d-76d31c79a043", "text": "你不该违背你的诺言。", "shortMeaning": "你不该说话不算数。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:347028ba-696a-409a-9a2b-6ecc225ea8c3", "text": "你不问我，我就不会说谎话。", "shortMeaning": "你不问，我就不撒谎。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fa7768fc-af6c-4fc5-86c9-98fdced89bdc", "text": "你不需要乘出租车。", "shortMeaning": "你不用打的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7219f407-bad6-47a3-a188-6346030fa56c", "text": "你不需要去看牙医。", "shortMeaning": "你不用去看牙。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:52e25a0b-e8c5-42d6-a28d-2313363e5ced", "text": "你不需要告诉我，我对这件事情没兴趣。", "shortMeaning": "不用跟我讲，这事我没兴趣。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:712a14ef-e86e-439a-9115-3c9ce973d687", "text": "你不需要提高你的音量。", "shortMeaning": "你不用把声调抬高。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:636cada5-ea09-46d6-ad65-0d309a661aae", "text": "你不需要说得这么大声。", "shortMeaning": "你不用讲这么响。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:403768d1-9b04-42d7-9ad7-45b9080561b5", "text": "你中文真好，都能引用俗语了。", "shortMeaning": "你中文学得好，俗话都能引。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b09970be-1710-4ea4-b022-e925af215cbe", "text": "你为什么一直不戒烟？", "shortMeaning": "你怎么一直不戒烟？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:57dc2137-31d8-4b3c-8a0b-6f91670e2376", "text": "你为什么不他的劝告？", "shortMeaning": "你怎么不听他的劝？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a201f7b5-5052-4125-9924-392ada45b523", "text": "你为什么不去加入她？", "shortMeaning": "你怎么不去跟她一道？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e0f1bd14-16c2-4069-a7fb-352058b12fce", "text": "你为什么不和我们一起来？", "shortMeaning": "你怎么不跟我们一道来？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fc252577-a17f-4d94-84e2-e292cf0fdf86", "text": "你为什么不在里面？", "shortMeaning": "你怎么没在里面？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:175df8b4-0eb9-497b-85b3-c40b6e1846ed", "text": "你为什么不留在这里？", "shortMeaning": "你怎么不待在这儿？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b5cb7f8d-b722-47e1-a209-50a85cf048f0", "text": "你为什么不直接炒了他？", "shortMeaning": "你怎么不干脆把他辞了？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1ee5c5d0-952b-452d-9f4b-3a7980fd8420", "text": "你为什么不相信呢？", "shortMeaning": "你怎么就不信呢？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4c2b3ddc-15c0-4177-9723-33904bf59cff", "text": "你为什么不相信我？", "shortMeaning": "你怎么不信我？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:76673620-55c9-4b44-962b-b19e5683eb48", "text": "你为什么不读这杂志呢？", "shortMeaning": "这杂志你怎么不读？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b27d0467-8791-4736-970e-af334be3696a", "text": "你为什么不这么做？", "shortMeaning": "你怎么不这样做？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:46bc674e-fb94-4238-b1ba-94aa692a5502", "text": "你为什么不阻止他们？", "shortMeaning": "你怎么不去拦着他们？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:16b2142b-6cac-433a-a346-28d0ac01201b", "text": "你为什么为我担忧？", "shortMeaning": "你替我担什么心？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:86673984-8f1c-4f57-a903-ff3d77297502", "text": "你为什么买这么多曲奇？", "shortMeaning": "你买这么多饼干做什么？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6906601f-32a1-430e-870f-2c9ba49f4fb5", "text": "你为什么会认为我在想你？", "shortMeaning": "你怎么会以为我在想你？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:adaae378-3651-4def-b46f-591dde45930a", "text": "你为什么会这么想？", "shortMeaning": "你怎么会这样想？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:306d5141-2c7d-40e5-bbaa-3afda278c73c", "text": "你为什么做了这种事儿？", "shortMeaning": "你怎么干出这种事？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ee2d5a79-21b8-4610-8bf1-37dba41fa52f", "text": "你为什么决定学法文了？", "shortMeaning": "你怎么决定学起法文了？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:78e16cf3-4b5e-4c36-aae9-8e385a297f70", "text": "你为什么对我这么小气？", "shortMeaning": "你怎么对我这么抠？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:26b29cc3-4888-4eee-931a-f52746807fab", "text": "你为什么总是发短信？", "shortMeaning": "你怎么老发短信？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b64d2787-24c8-4609-9fff-a721b84c4522", "text": "你为什么总是逃避这个话题？", "shortMeaning": "你怎么总躲着这个话题？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b3f0b005-5a5a-4577-89a2-833b658d3758", "text": "你为什么总来得这么晚？", "shortMeaning": "你怎么总来这么晚？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a02e449f-5b0c-49ef-ab64-a201a3bd72cb", "text": "你为什么想成为护士呢？", "shortMeaning": "你怎么想当护士呢？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:71e82bbb-c47e-4377-9a67-f19bd8d9b409", "text": "你为什么戴那条围巾？", "shortMeaning": "你干吗戴那条围巾？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c60d5211-a53b-4e93-9374-86395b5bca87", "text": "你为什么来了日本？", "shortMeaning": "你怎么到日本来了？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:76ca3bcf-464f-41f0-b0eb-108e5c3f4120", "text": "你为什么给我这些钱？", "shortMeaning": "你给我这些钱做什么？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:56e871dc-5ddc-4bd3-90ac-d9b069bc1a9d", "text": "你为什么老说个不停？", "shortMeaning": "你怎么说个没完？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d4e35b1f-ea33-4973-99e5-34d0f5b86a0d", "text": "你为什么而读书呢？", "shortMeaning": "你读书是为了什么？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d8a291df-2a23-4d53-8f2c-db3e7b8f3c14", "text": "你为什么装得这么刻意？", "shortMeaning": "你怎么装得这么假？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:315c32d1-2d17-4c5a-98da-55a3b08a39a5", "text": "你为什么要和他说话？", "shortMeaning": "你跟他搭话做什么？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:40bfc99a-1154-4b79-bfa5-1d934be41694", "text": "你为什么要和经理争论？", "shortMeaning": "你干吗跟经理争？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e8849c47-207c-4aa1-9988-a9d432cc7005", "text": "你为什么要在这里买？都好贵啊。", "shortMeaning": "干吗在这儿买？都贵得很。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a90184d1-9268-40b4-9bee-05b1f497b8ce", "text": "你为什么要这么拼命？", "shortMeaning": "你何苦这么拼？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0fd87567-4ce5-468b-af7f-0e69cd1d1b64", "text": "你为什么要骂人家？", "shortMeaning": "你干吗骂人？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1976eb53-faf4-4179-88a4-b5daaa154318", "text": "你为什么觉得我们在这？", "shortMeaning": "你怎么觉得我们在这儿？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:073dacf1-488f-417d-9a07-23e747a0493a", "text": "你为什么这么可怜？", "shortMeaning": "你怎么这么可怜？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9ab98637-76d7-45c7-8386-eaabcc1b0117", "text": "你为什么这么含糊其辞？", "shortMeaning": "你怎么话说得这么含糊？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9ae000f2-929a-49b9-aefa-b99c4b46716c", "text": "你为什么选这首歌？", "shortMeaning": "你怎么挑了这首歌？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f2081810-9c17-4b52-9f6c-3eebcf415e3a", "text": "你为什么长不大呢？", "shortMeaning": "你怎么老长不大呢？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5dd8819c-e604-4632-a296-29203ec7576b", "text": "你为什么问我的观点？", "shortMeaning": "你问我的看法做什么？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5b99475d-e170-49f0-8c87-d45bf3468d4f", "text": "你主食喜欢吃面还是吃饭？", "shortMeaning": "你正餐爱吃面还是爱吃饭？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bfcfbf0f-4207-4b0b-9f5f-1c5cd05dac57", "text": "你举了一个不好的例子。", "shortMeaning": "你这例子举得不好。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:652eb1a8-f8d4-42b6-a381-1ed173125008", "text": "你之下在整些喃样？", "shortMeaning": "你这会儿在弄些什么？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:68c71984-23fd-456b-bc57-9a124a23d47f", "text": "你之前也说过这个。", "shortMeaning": "这话你从前也说过。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c21eaebb-0a91-4a78-9ec5-e2b915a8dc5f", "text": "你也太会做买卖了啊。", "shortMeaning": "你这买卖也太会做了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cc65428e-14fd-4658-97d1-862cb31e1a59", "text": "你也是其中一个吧！", "shortMeaning": "你也是里头的一个吧！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ca400fc6-f1dc-44c0-bbc9-b79e59bb501a", "text": "你也觉得锤子手机很酷啊！", "shortMeaning": "你也觉得锤子手机很酷吧！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:875c58a4-09c3-415d-ba77-70524e9d0079", "text": "你也许不会记得，而我永远不会忘记。", "shortMeaning": "你也许记不得，我却永远不忘。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:42c74a75-dc70-4778-a81a-d0e2f5387bbe", "text": "你也许会染上疾病。", "shortMeaning": "你也许会染上病。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:edc609fd-ff0d-46ba-9fec-c72c182a054f", "text": "你也许要寻求他的帮助。", "shortMeaning": "你也许得求他帮。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:91ec70c9-3a28-422d-b424-706cbae837bd", "text": "你也邀请你的朋友了吗？", "shortMeaning": "你也请了你的朋友吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5892be93-2d87-4485-85d8-8d762583d2d1", "text": "你书中提出了个有意思的命题。", "shortMeaning": "你书里提出个有趣的说法。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:48707086-61fd-4495-9e3c-9539e87121c8", "text": "你买不买一个西瓜？", "shortMeaning": "要不要买个西瓜？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1562b75e-9fd1-4ad3-a931-26ae4a414b7a", "text": "你买了些什么特产呀？", "shortMeaning": "你买了什么本地货？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c1337bf3-8561-4d5a-bd72-7e349bb8d2cb", "text": "你买了往返的票吗？", "shortMeaning": "你买的是来回票吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:975a9a93-157c-41ba-8744-7809f7f8cbb4", "text": "你买了本什么样的书？", "shortMeaning": "你买了本什么书？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c6af0235-10d4-4fbf-bb9b-96ff4b64e2e0", "text": "你买回程机票了吗？", "shortMeaning": "你订了回程的机票吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:97ba9ca1-71dc-4e3e-9c00-66134484046a", "text": "你什么意思？你到底想对我说什么？", "shortMeaning": "你什么意思？究竟想跟我说什么？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ac57ae18-3b2d-4480-95fc-b83314c13365", "text": "你什么时候从米兰回来？", "shortMeaning": "你几时从米兰回来？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2c753599-b229-421f-9aaf-140555e4d84e", "text": "你什么时候去伦敦的？", "shortMeaning": "你哪时去的伦敦？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8afff8bb-ade5-48d6-a0f8-b470575665cb", "text": "你什么时候去悉尼？", "shortMeaning": "你几时去悉尼？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c1c649f8-6954-4363-9b6d-1f90d3d2d2bf", "text": "你什么时候去月球？我们都需要你。", "shortMeaning": "你几时去月球？我们都缺你不得。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c9bc5573-72e1-4f97-8f41-57179edd776e", "text": "你什么时候去欧洲？", "shortMeaning": "你什么时候动身去欧洲？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ffc0d013-6269-4572-8241-5ae75f3aa57d", "text": "你什么时候去那里？", "shortMeaning": "你几时到那儿去？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4a831def-017b-45b1-bf6e-3808184d250d", "text": "你什么时候告诉过我？", "shortMeaning": "你几时跟我说过？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a057658b-e1c8-4cc3-8c5c-b0137b4cac94", "text": "你什么时候回到阿尔及利亚？", "shortMeaning": "你几时回阿尔及利亚？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6cdcbc0a-5935-4f30-9faf-3a668c80aea8", "text": "你什么时候回意大利？", "shortMeaning": "你几时回意大利？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:381a2be9-2803-427c-958a-2af476b78c4b", "text": "你什么时候学会游泳的？", "shortMeaning": "你什么时候学会游水的？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:205ea86f-1a5b-4844-8585-e835dc01fc21", "text": "你什么时候将去亚美尼亚？", "shortMeaning": "你几时要去亚美尼亚？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f3a3964c-e09e-438e-ae27-50f2f3994a40", "text": "你什么时候开始学英语的？", "shortMeaning": "你从什么时候起学英语？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d322e6ec-f4b1-4ead-91bf-2e6fd085cd22", "text": "你什么时候找到的？", "shortMeaning": "这是你几时找着的？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fb0357c4-9358-4355-87af-66787aa1cdc2", "text": "你什么时候放暑假？", "shortMeaning": "你几时放暑假？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d2818d9d-7a34-4181-9c92-54e083a1ea9c", "text": "你什么时候来日本？", "shortMeaning": "你几时来日本？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:20bcbfeb-b7b3-4ab3-8646-538189a8a6ec", "text": "你什么时候洗下你的车。", "shortMeaning": "你什么时候把车洗一洗。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cb849a92-3c1e-4cfe-ac01-2de5f8b9b899", "text": "你什么时候爱上我的？", "shortMeaning": "你几时爱上我的？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a85f20c8-e851-47c3-b158-deb1f3b5940e", "text": "你什么时候看见过冰雹吗？", "shortMeaning": "你哪时见过下冰雹？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:67bb605a-f257-46f4-84bc-31a4e60064a7", "text": "你什么时候看那部电影？", "shortMeaning": "你几时看那部片子？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:eaae9477-47d1-47fc-ae3b-582eb300cbba", "text": "你什么时候给我做事？", "shortMeaning": "你几时给我干活？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:432b35a0-f5ad-4cc8-a110-c60732393f06", "text": "你什么时候能来我家？", "shortMeaning": "你什么时候能到我家来？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:745712c9-4d09-4511-851f-b3d82f94f8d7", "text": "你什么时候起来了？", "shortMeaning": "你什么时候起的？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:886e8203-dadf-4381-9b7d-5e7806e26973", "text": "你什么时候需要的？", "shortMeaning": "你什么时候要的？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fdd5bc1e-e884-41c4-bb95-2c97d1dd0360", "text": "你什么都没跟他说？", "shortMeaning": "你什么都没告诉他？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:08b21f65-e204-4b2d-bc69-937282c1f892", "text": "你什么都知道，对吗？", "shortMeaning": "你什么都清楚，是不是？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5addfa9f-608c-404d-903a-b97b21ccbca2", "text": "你仅仅是一个小时前才开始这份工作的。", "shortMeaning": "这活你一小时前才干起。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3dc3995f-4146-46f1-972f-ab7b0f4cb746", "text": "你今儿跟平日里不太一样。", "shortMeaning": "你今天跟平常不大一样。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a5d73116-fca7-4b9a-8a49-7704c99846e3", "text": "你今天下去锻炼了吗？", "shortMeaning": "你今天下午锻炼了吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:965c61ba-cbf7-4a1f-aa64-4715f2dea78e", "text": "你今天不在工作吗？", "shortMeaning": "你今天不上班吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5ef7ceaf-77fb-42d9-9d06-721feb23ce9d", "text": "你今天不是应该在学校的吗？", "shortMeaning": "你今天不是该在学校吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:beb154aa-9e76-49dd-94ed-f8a4b082d7c5", "text": "你今天是不是有点发烧？", "shortMeaning": "你今天有点发热吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bc880612-a64d-4ada-805d-0c6c68ed622f", "text": "你今天有点发烧，是吧？", "shortMeaning": "你今天有点热，对吧？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f41b32e4-1136-4551-bff7-9e0b0c956ad5", "text": "你今天看上去很开心。", "shortMeaning": "你今天看着挺高兴。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:226754cd-79d0-4412-bcf4-20e3d546d643", "text": "你今年做的最刺激的事是什么？", "shortMeaning": "你今年干的最带劲的事是什么？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7fd06de7-372c-4186-8dad-e583b8c71f80", "text": "你今早为什么迟到了？", "shortMeaning": "你早上怎么迟到了？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7526c968-5420-476d-868f-304a07b05f19", "text": "你今晚喝了东西吗？", "shortMeaning": "你今晚喝过东西吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:69ddeeb3-3fd7-4e06-93b7-6c7e04ae1169", "text": "你今晚有什么打算？", "shortMeaning": "今晚你有什么打算？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8348aa23-845a-48a9-9b53-42fc9149e9a6", "text": "你今晚要去剧院吗？", "shortMeaning": "你今晚去戏院吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1ac341c3-302b-4397-97d8-b32affc0dd1a", "text": "你今晚要去见简吗？", "shortMeaning": "你今晚去见简吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:06c36bd9-70a8-4582-9e95-5a4d92a33086", "text": "你介不介意我在这里吸烟？", "shortMeaning": "我在这儿抽根烟行吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:273535b9-5793-49f1-987c-7a9d71151a7f", "text": "你介意我在这儿待一会儿吗？", "shortMeaning": "我在这儿待一会儿碍事吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3c4206fb-d30a-410c-ba4c-ef5de8cf15d4", "text": "你介意我抽根烟吗？", "shortMeaning": "我抽根烟你不介意吧？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6a13295d-a980-4f95-b15d-53e80fba39c5", "text": "你介意跟我一起来吗？", "shortMeaning": "跟我一道来，你愿意吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cc716c92-3fd2-4b59-ada7-3d1311e79ba9", "text": "你从哪儿买的这些蛋？", "shortMeaning": "这些蛋你从哪儿买的？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:84b53ffd-40ee-47f6-845b-2867d04b2e30", "text": "你从哪里得到这么多钱的？", "shortMeaning": "这么多钱你从哪儿弄来的？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7c1f6028-0c90-4608-bd4d-30907e7b93e9", "text": "你从哪里得到这些古钱的？", "shortMeaning": "这些古钱你从哪儿得的？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:95c582de-26be-4fa1-811a-fff31bcfff2b", "text": "你从来不听，就好像我是在跟一堵墙说话。", "shortMeaning": "你从不听，我像对着墙讲。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cf5c7038-50aa-42a3-9390-3475ecc23bc9", "text": "你从来不明白我的玩笑。", "shortMeaning": "我的玩笑你从没听懂过。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1a196fca-5b6e-452d-8515-8084dbb7d5a0", "text": "你从来吮了阴茎吗？", "shortMeaning": "问对方以往有没有过这种性行为。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7533f4d3-1ae8-4dc9-82ee-2dcce7c246d9", "text": "你从来没有告诉我你想学弹班卓琴。", "shortMeaning": "你从没说过想学弹班卓琴。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:64172b73-b7b6-4c67-bc9e-7e1ec910cc8f", "text": "你从来没有注意过我。", "shortMeaning": "你从没留意过我。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0af43e66-a221-4bff-8758-085ae06d0dff", "text": "你从来没课还是怎样？", "shortMeaning": "你是没课还是怎么？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ced3f319-b7f8-426d-8943-1ac21cfd4c56", "text": "你从桌下爬出来吧！", "shortMeaning": "你从桌子底下爬出来吧！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1e35a19c-cd16-41ef-ad3b-4b5fb941a0e6", "text": "你从没听过她在台上唱歌吗？", "shortMeaning": "你没听过她在台上唱吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e43f0dcc-8bf8-4522-ad12-c647195b58a3", "text": "你从没来过这儿，对吗？", "shortMeaning": "你没来过这儿，对吧？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:27504f6b-f59c-4c4f-9702-d1edeffece57", "text": "你从这里过去到那里，穿过第二条横马路就是。", "shortMeaning": "从这儿过去，穿过第二条横街就到。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1ebfcd33-55a6-41ab-9a6e-cffc44335795", "text": "你仔细看看，太新鲜啦！", "shortMeaning": "你细看，新鲜得很！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a87b4acf-c57e-4bf5-a5c5-19a22122a419", "text": "你以为这是拍电影。", "shortMeaning": "你以为这是在拍戏。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bcd6f67e-8dab-4a4d-b3d8-e4d9ee4c9143", "text": "你以前应该听过这个故事。", "shortMeaning": "这故事你以前该听过。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:306d3832-11e7-4f22-9125-e58f8289b2b1", "text": "你们一直什么都不告诉我。", "shortMeaning": "你们一直什么都不跟我说。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a589b9aa-7d18-429f-875f-24f3df8be35a", "text": "你们一般几点下班？", "shortMeaning": "你们平常几点下班？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ef17e0cd-23d0-42c5-961c-92f3f4d07d4a", "text": "你们不喜欢坐飞机。", "shortMeaning": "你们不爱坐飞机。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5ddf93e5-5b30-4614-aa81-c906c1d0e31e", "text": "你们不想的话，就不要关于这个事情聊天。", "shortMeaning": "你们不愿意，就别聊这件事。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9070bc4c-26c8-4287-89ba-5a17bfcb45ae", "text": "你们不能炒了我们。", "shortMeaning": "你们不能把我们辞了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8aeed3ea-dbab-4c6f-af18-a09c6f343af2", "text": "你们不能解雇我们。", "shortMeaning": "你们不能把我们开掉。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:514ea298-491c-4664-87ac-93aa52203bc0", "text": "你们不要再打了啦！", "shortMeaning": "你们别再打了！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:23535535-9910-4f32-811c-659ba4e1a291", "text": "你们两个人都准备好了吗？", "shortMeaning": "你们俩都准备好了吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:05f64595-de7e-4f71-a3db-8ec58d39851f", "text": "你们两个做了什么有趣的事情呢？", "shortMeaning": "你们俩做了什么好玩的事？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bf346958-754f-41c9-a9cf-6701d3a6c7ae", "text": "你们两个在一起多久了？", "shortMeaning": "你们俩在一块儿多久了？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:589a1096-5ede-4639-b963-db4b6a7fe123", "text": "你们两个无聊胚子！", "shortMeaning": "你们俩真是没趣的家伙！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d79c38e7-3e59-4e6d-bd0e-116666807fa1", "text": "你们两个误了我一生。", "shortMeaning": "你们俩耽误了我一辈子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4cffcb95-c5f4-4e8e-b384-9a84a507d516", "text": "你们也太大胆了吧！", "shortMeaning": "你们胆子也太大了！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1fec8b3b-89e8-40f5-ae98-ff74a46219d4", "text": "你们习惯吃日本的食物了吗？", "shortMeaning": "日本饭菜你们吃得惯了吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:22e47f7c-520d-4abe-a9d4-65724aab91e1", "text": "你们什么时候回意大利？", "shortMeaning": "你们几时回意大利？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8cd883fa-0137-4368-bf5d-494a02aa1dc2", "text": "你们什么时候开始学英语的？", "shortMeaning": "你们从什么时候学起英语？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2ed0372e-2747-4fd7-aa80-8cc592cf8377", "text": "你们什么时候开始营业？", "shortMeaning": "你们几时开门做生意？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2cdebde7-dcdc-4272-99eb-a8f7f8c15cb8", "text": "你们今天下午在学校做些什么？", "shortMeaning": "你们今天下午在学校干什么？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:91329e9d-9f3d-46d8-a82c-2099798f68d7", "text": "你们会有几个人去？", "shortMeaning": "你们去几个人？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4f240b3a-786f-47b9-973f-eaf8e8deb479", "text": "你们会讲加泰罗尼亚语吗？", "shortMeaning": "你们会说加泰罗尼亚话吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ccb69100-ba07-450c-8492-bbbe182e2aec", "text": "你们会说波兰语吗？", "shortMeaning": "你们会讲波兰话吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3cded68c-d0b4-4b19-8566-60da82e70312", "text": "你们俩之间是不是出现了什么问题？他怎么最近都不来接你了？", "shortMeaning": "你们俩是不是出了什么事？他近来怎么不来接你？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ec6ea60a-aa54-4171-8f53-03aff897ef98", "text": "你们俩什么时候见面的？", "shortMeaning": "你们俩什么时候见的？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c92e66b9-cd13-41cd-bead-8f92457e7232", "text": "你们俩真扫我的雅兴。", "shortMeaning": "你们俩真把我的兴致搅了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ffac0953-2b3b-4678-88b9-a13e4d833304", "text": "你们做出的东西，当成玩具的话还是很有趣的，但我们不认为那是汽车。", "shortMeaning": "你们做的东西当玩具有意思，可我们不当它是车。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5977a128-b78f-49e3-bc86-1896568135bf", "text": "你们全部一定要读。", "shortMeaning": "你们全都得读。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cfbd72fd-8b13-42a4-9d10-08e9d40c8957", "text": "你们共住一个房间吗？", "shortMeaning": "你们合住一间房吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8048db35-4712-405f-b410-b47bb5fabeb1", "text": "你们准备如何达到你们制定的目标？", "shortMeaning": "你们打算怎样达成定下的目标？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3df9ee7a-8d49-4306-a093-ec0f04526886", "text": "你们几乎什么都没有吃。", "shortMeaning": "你们几乎什么都没吃。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cb4db648-fec8-46af-9d77-22e9465cc8e3", "text": "你们到底对我做了什么？", "shortMeaning": "你们究竟对我干了什么？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3cfa7bb2-f093-4bf8-8e71-a59664d02932", "text": "你们可以搜索含有某个词的句子并得到这些句子的翻译。", "shortMeaning": "可以搜含某个词的句子，并看到这些句子的译文。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8edc0013-8ef8-46b0-a7f4-4fbdf9d64313", "text": "你们可以搜索词并得到翻译。但这真不是一本寻常的字典。", "shortMeaning": "可以搜词看译文，可这真不是本平常字典。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:96f544e9-5c3e-4bad-9028-fee76b66e66a", "text": "你们告诉你们家长了吗？", "shortMeaning": "你们跟家里说了吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6eae4b7b-adfe-4147-aa41-1b9113647c81", "text": "你们四大门派榜上都有名。", "shortMeaning": "四大门派在榜上都有名。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:373519c5-f3cc-49e3-8163-c9c91190110f", "text": "你们在哪找到我的雨伞的？", "shortMeaning": "我的伞你们在哪儿找着的？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cffa2bb9-0b37-4419-8e3a-e8a4ab8e3817", "text": "你们在巴黎看到了什么？", "shortMeaning": "你们在巴黎见到些什么？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ac1a868a-442e-4eea-a115-3a78c5aeed11", "text": "你们在这里做什么？", "shortMeaning": "你们在这儿忙什么？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7e1afcd2-9d3d-4115-8213-9760401e8e27", "text": "你们好，你们在做什么？", "shortMeaning": "你们好，在忙什么呢？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:dbbdb423-c392-4e80-9bbd-da152bbec324", "text": "你们对外语感兴趣吗？", "shortMeaning": "你们对外语有兴趣吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:02005e8a-1ee1-4ffc-b8c4-2c9d5bcc2d69", "text": "你们应该完成你们的作业。", "shortMeaning": "你们该把作业做完。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:04351ed7-f937-4528-a9e7-24c9b1824bc7", "text": "你们庭院里有桌子吗？", "shortMeaning": "你们院子里有桌子吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5cb02322-78bd-4d98-bebf-115e2d21019c", "text": "你们很容易就能看出区别。", "shortMeaning": "差别你们一眼就能看出来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bf9a1fab-2354-4c26-aaf1-b62a70032444", "text": "你们很过分诶，十点才到！", "shortMeaning": "你们太过分了，十点才到！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5114389f-37a7-44ce-a311-9a268829523d", "text": "你们怎么会认识的？", "shortMeaning": "你们怎么认识的？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:718511b2-3dcf-4307-ac05-4961cdc69e11", "text": "你们怎么得出这个结论的？", "shortMeaning": "你们这结论是怎么得出来的？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:492037d3-9e8b-4914-9051-0808065e8855", "text": "你们怎么样？我很久没见你们了。", "shortMeaning": "你们好吗？好久没见了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4e766afc-d687-4660-9968-4b8ebce2fafc", "text": "你们怎么读这个词？", "shortMeaning": "这个词你们怎么念？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:17e70b09-6917-4e44-9120-89ae0b0f03fc", "text": "你们恐怕是认错人了吧！", "shortMeaning": "你们怕是把人认错了！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c036232b-6703-4851-bf9e-9ccff4e35e1c", "text": "你们想吃几串烤羊肉？", "shortMeaning": "你们要几串烤羊肉？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d75a022f-66bf-4aa4-8d42-9523692e4190", "text": "你们放假的时候做了什么？", "shortMeaning": "放假那阵你们做了什么？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ee88b3ac-c88e-45e4-a88f-19f5c15a598b", "text": "你们明白他想说些什么吗？", "shortMeaning": "他想说什么你们懂吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:aaac104f-3374-49a2-b455-5f3b53d2c2ce", "text": "你们是不是在首尔认识的？", "shortMeaning": "你们是在首尔认识的吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:84e79bc9-b80d-49b2-8565-06a2051883e9", "text": "你们是个非常好的团队，但他们的是最好的。", "shortMeaning": "你们这队很好，可他们那队最好。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:16765b0b-7948-4a34-944a-0cd8477d1e8e", "text": "你们是加拿大人吗？", "shortMeaning": "你们是加拿大来的吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2f65a246-00e3-4955-ab21-f3a6dc262182", "text": "你们是在哪里认识的？", "shortMeaning": "你们在哪儿认识的？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
